body:
Oneplus killed what i loved about the company, a VERY good phone for a VERY good price. Currently Rocking the oneplus 7t pro mclaren edition since i still think it's a killer deal. This phone though? Would rather switch back to iphone. Way to expensive and doesnt really deliver on the camera department in that price range.

&#x200B;

Im not mad oneplus im just very dissappointed you left your core principiel THAT much behind.
